# 🚀 CareerAI - Intelligent Career Recommendation Platform

An AI-powered career platform that analyzes resumes and recommends personalized job opportunities using OpenAI LLMs and Selenium LinkedIn scraping.

---

## 📦 Project Structure

```
career_platform/
├── app.py                  # Main Streamlit entry point
├── requirements.txt        # Python dependencies
├── users.json              # Auto-generated user database
└── pages/
    ├── auth.py             # Login & Registration (Module 1)
    ├── dashboard.py        # Home dashboard
    ├── resume.py           # Resume upload & parsing (Module 1)
    ├── insights.py         # AI Resume Analysis (Module 2)
    ├── jobs.py             # Job scraping & recommendations (Module 3)
    └── settings.py         # API keys & configuration
```

---

## 🛠️ Setup & Installation

### 1. Install Dependencies
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 2. (Optional) Install Chrome Driver for Selenium
```bash
pip install webdriver-manager
```
Or download ChromeDriver matching your Chrome version from: https://chromedriver.chromium.org/

### 3. Run the Application
```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

---

## 🔑 Configuration

1. **OpenAI API Key** — Go to `Settings` inside the app and paste your key.
   - Get one at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
   - The platform uses `gpt-4o-mini` (fast & affordable)

2. **LinkedIn Scraping** — Two modes available:
   - **AI Mode (Recommended):** Uses OpenAI to generate realistic, matched job listings
   - **Selenium Mode:** Scrapes real LinkedIn public job pages (no login required for basic scraping)

---

## 🧩 Modules

### Module 1: User Registration & Resume Analysis
- Secure user registration with hashed passwords
- PDF resume upload (via PyPDF2/pdfplumber)
- Plain text resume paste option
- Local JSON-based user storage

### Module 2: AI-Powered Resume Insights
- GPT-4o-mini powered resume analysis
- Overall score (1-10), ATS score, content score, formatting score
- Strengths, gaps, target roles, missing keywords
- 5+ personalized recommendations with priority levels
- Industry fit and certification recommendations

### Module 3: LinkedIn Scraping & Job Recommendations
- Selenium headless Chrome scraping of LinkedIn jobs
- Fallback to AI-generated realistic job listings
- Match scoring per candidate profile
- Job cards with company, location, requirements, salary

---

## 🌐 Tech Stack

| Component | Technology |
|-----------|-----------|
| Frontend | Streamlit |
| AI/LLM | OpenAI GPT-4o-mini |
| Web Scraping | Selenium + ChromeDriver |
| PDF Parsing | PyPDF2, pdfplumber |
| Auth | SHA-256 + JSON storage |
| Styling | Custom CSS (dark theme) |

---

## 📸 Features at a Glance

- 🌙 Dark themed, modern UI
- 🔐 Secure user accounts
- 📊 Visual resume scoring dashboard  
- 🤖 GPT-powered analysis & recommendations
- 🌐 Real LinkedIn job scraping (Selenium)
- 🎯 AI-generated personalized job matches
- 📄 PDF & text resume support
- ⚡ Session-based, no cloud dependency

---

## ⚠️ Notes

- LinkedIn may block automated scraping. Use AI mode if Selenium fails.
- Keep your OpenAI API key private.
- The app runs fully locally — no data is sent anywhere except to OpenAI's API.